/*  EXPECTED: COMPILES and runs; compiled output must match the interpreter.

    A second name, made in a rabbit, for an outer series of numbers; a number is inserted through it.

    Nothing here outlives its region, and nothing is refused: every store is judged against
    where its target really lives (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O2). */

Define totals as a series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define alias as totals.
    Insert 5 into alias.
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State totals.
